  "id": "BIT-grafana-2026-110992",
  "summary": "Path traversal in Git Sync delete and move jobs",
  "details": "A user who can create Git Sync provisioning jobs (the Editor role by default) could delete or move files outside the configured repository path with a job that references a resource whose source path contains ../ sequences (path traversal). With a local filesystem repository on versions before 13.0.4 and 13.1.1, this reached files on the Grafana host.",
